  "description_en": "<p>This Unreal Engine-based video project captures summer scenery as if through a camera lens. I sought to compose a perspective that views summer from within a virtual space and to convey the atmosphere of the season through the camera’s framing and movement.</p>\n            <p>Just as one might capture a moment in a passing landscape that makes you want to linger, I recorded a scene of summer on film.</p>",
